+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : conductor C0 == sub(nodes, C0)                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : C = canonicalImage C0                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = C                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : betti res ideal C                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|             0 1  2 3 4                                                      |
|o10 = total: 1 6 10 6 1                                                      |
|          0: 1 .  . . .                                                      |
|          1: . 6  5 . .                                                      |
|          2: . .  5 6 .                                                      |
|          3: . .  . . 1                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : BettiTally                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : B' = gens image basis (3,intersect nodes)                              |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = 0                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|               1                                                             |
|o11 : Matrix P2  <-- 0                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The ideal of nodes is the conductor, so the canonical series on C is the
restriction of the set of cubics containing the nodes.

+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : B = sub(B',C);                                                      |
|                                                                          |
|              1                                                           |
|o12 : Matrix C  <-- 0                                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : canC = projectiveImage B                                            |
|                                                                          |
|o13 = canC                                                                |
|                                                                          |
|o13 : PolynomialRing                                                      |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : delPezzo = P5/ker(map(P2, P5, gens image basis (3,intersect nodes)))|
|                                                                          |
|o14 = delPezzo                                                            |
|                                                                          |
|o14 : QuotientRing                                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i15 : betti res ideal canC                                                |
|                                                                          |
|             0                                                            |
|o15 = total: 1                                                            |
|          0: 1                                                            |
|                                                                          |
|o15 : BettiTally                                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : betti res ideal delPezzo                                            |
|                                                                          |
|             0 1  2  3  4 5 6                                             |
|o16 = total: 1 6 15 20 15 6 1                                             |
|          0: 1 6 15 20 15 6 1                                             |
|                                                                          |
|o16 : BettiTally                                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+

