toCoordinates -- coordinates of a point from its ideal
******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L  = toCoordinates I
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, defining a point
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of elements of the ground field

Description
===========

This is the inverse of *note fromCoordinates: fromCoordinates,

+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/5[x,y,z]                                    |
|                                                        |
|o1 = S                                                  |
|                                                        |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(x- y, z)                                 |
|                                                        |
|o2 = ideal (x - y, z)                                   |
|                                                        |
|o2 : Ideal of S                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : L = toCoordinates I                                |
|                                                        |
|o3 = {1, 1, 0}                                          |
|                                                        |
|o3 : List                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : I == fromCoordinates(L,S)                          |
|                                                        |
|o4 = true                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : S = GF(5,2,Variable => a)[x,y,z]/(ideal "x3-y3+z3")|
|                                                        |
|o5 = S                                                  |
|                                                        |
|o5 : QuotientRing                                       |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : a^24 == 1                                          |
|                                                        |
|o6 = true                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : (a^8)^3                                            |
|                                                        |
|o7 = 1                                                  |
|                                                        |
|o7 : GF 25                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : (a^16)^3                                           |
|                                                        |
|o8 = 1                                                  |
|                                                        |
|o8 : GF 25                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : p = {a^8, a^16, 0}                                 |
|                                                        |
|o9 = {2a + 1, - 2a - 2, 0}                              |
|                                                        |
|o9 : List                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : fromCoordinates (p,S)                             |
|                                                        |
|o10 = ideal ((- 2a - 1)x + y, z)                        |
|                                                        |
|o10 : Ideal of S                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : L = toCoordinates fromCoordinates ({a^8,1,0}, S)  |
|                                                        |
|o11 = {2a + 1, 1, 0}                                    |
|                                                        |
|o11 : List                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------+

